      "On premises, at an edge site or on hosting you select."
    ],
    [
      "Control",
      "Keep the control plane",
      "Xmip’s architecture avoids dependence on a hosted control plane."
    ],
    [
      "Stewardship",
      "Review the implementation",
      """\
Source, interface contracts and recorded decisions support technical \
