      "Bring them in",
      "Move packages into the disconnected environment."
    ],
    [
      "03",
      "Operate locally",
      "Installation and runtime follow Xmip’s offline-first design."
    ]
  ],
  """\
Online capability is declared explicitly. Connectivity can be restricted, \
intermittent or intentionally absent.\
"""
]

[[section]]
title = "One operating model"
headline = "Different surfaces, shared meaning"
screen = """\
CLI and PowerShell for automation\nDesktop and web for investigation\nThe \
same scopes, meanings and actions\
"""
voice = "male"
power = false
narration = """\
Operators can choose a command line, PowerShell, desktop or web interface \
without learning a different platform model. The same scopes and meanings \
guide investigation. Automation and visual inspection become different \
ways to work with the same operational evidence.\
"""
sources = [
  "doc/decision/ADR-0014-operator-surfaces.md",
  "doc/decision/README.md"
]
